---
description: Rails 8 conventions for the sample todo app
alwaysApply: true
---

- Prefer Turbo Streams over custom JavaScript for dynamic UI updates
- Keep all migrations reversible (use `reversible do` or paired up/down)
- Always use strong parameters in controllers
- Use `bin/rails generate` rather than hand-writing boilerplate files
- Keep the schema scoped to the todo app — do not import models or migrations from other projects
- Follow RESTful routing conventions
- Use partials for repeated view logic